  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TCPF: Technical Assistant to the development of the National Action Plan for the UN Food System Dialogue process and  the formulation of the Rice Agro Industrial Cluster (RAIC) project for Sierra Leone</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To develop an investment tool in the form of National Action plan used to mobilize resources to implement the recommendations of the UN food system dialogue process and also develop a new rice value chain project that will contribute to better production, food and nutrition security, job creation and poverty reduction in Sierra Leone</narrative>
  </description>
